WEBVTT

00:01.870 --> 00:09.030
As Satoshi and his friends continue their journey in order to challenge the Eisetsu Gym, they feverishly engage in Pokémon battle training.

00:01.950 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:09.560 --> 00:11.290
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

00:14.270 --> 00:16.040
Pikachu, dodge and use Electro Ball!

00:18.340 --> 00:19.860
Gekkouga, Cut!

00:27.840 --> 00:30.300
Good job, Gekkouga! Use Double Team next!

00:32.280 --> 00:34.930
Whoa, all three of them are so pumped!

00:35.260 --> 00:37.580
Once I have put these away, I am going to be their opponent!

00:38.030 --> 00:40.970
Geez! At this rate you're going to catch a cold!

00:42.910 --> 00:44.220
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:51.020 --> 00:53.780
I've heard you've been producing splendid results in Kalos.

00:54.080 --> 00:56.420
You seem to be doing well.

00:56.810 --> 00:57.200
Sir!

00:58.240 --> 00:59.560
Especially you, Nyarth.

00:59.560 --> 00:59.900
Wha-?!

01:00.210 --> 01:06.210
I'm amazed by your smarts, the way you operate mechs... your contributions to Operation: Get Pikachu.

01:06.490 --> 01:08.560
Thank you. I'm grateful and happy.

01:08.840 --> 01:09.890
Let me reward you.

01:17.290 --> 01:19.230
Th-This hurts...

01:20.890 --> 01:23.430
It hurts, Sakaki-sama...

01:22.670 --> 01:23.430
Nyarth!

01:23.780 --> 01:24.670
Sonansu!

01:24.960 --> 01:25.880
Maaiika!

01:26.910 --> 01:28.530
How much longer do you intend to sleep?

01:28.530 --> 01:30.590
Let's hurry and go get Pikachu.

01:30.590 --> 01:32.780
Geez, those sleepyheads...

01:35.140 --> 01:36.530
Oh, it was just a dream...

01:36.890 --> 01:38.740
You were going "Oh Sakaki-sama".

01:38.740 --> 01:40.740
What kind of dream was it?

01:41.310 --> 01:42.680
W-Well...

01:43.120 --> 01:44.250
Anyway!

01:44.490 --> 01:46.940
Let's send that powerful Pikachu...

01:46.940 --> 01:49.040
...to Sakaki-sama as soon as possible!

01:52.880 --> 01:53.650
Tell me!

01:53.860 --> 01:55.160
Is that "strong Pikachu" you're talking about...

01:56.410 --> 01:58.200
...even stronger...

01:58.430 --> 02:01.720
...than mine? Huh?!

02:02.290 --> 02:04.020
Here comes a noisy one.

02:04.020 --> 02:06.680
Geez, a bothersome kid at such an ungodly hour...

02:07.360 --> 02:08.830
I'm the Wandering Guitarist!

02:09.550 --> 02:12.410
They also call me Jimmy the Pikachu Trainer!

02:13.130 --> 02:16.450
And this is my Pikachu partner, whose name is Spike!

02:17.940 --> 02:20.670
I'm traveling in search for strong Pikachu!

02:21.010 --> 02:22.560
What's wrong with them...?

02:24.730 --> 02:25.070
So?

02:25.530 --> 02:27.250
Where's this Pikachu?

02:28.350 --> 02:30.140
Where it is? As if we got a clue...

02:30.450 --> 02:31.470
Yeah...

02:31.470 --> 02:32.500
Right.

02:36.210 --> 02:41.920
Serena Becomes Satoshi!
The Ultimate Pikachu Showdown!!

02:42.920 --> 02:52.850
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

02:42.920 --> 02:52.850
Z

02:47.910 --> 02:49.260
Satoshi is late.

02:49.910 --> 02:52.290
He was training until late yesterday, so...

02:52.850 --> 02:54.800
Eureka, please go wake him up.

02:55.120 --> 02:55.450
Okay!

02:57.240 --> 02:58.230
Ah, Satoshi!

02:58.530 --> 02:59.790
The food's done already.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.010
Done...

03:01.650 --> 03:02.440
It's done...

03:02.670 --> 03:03.330
Good morning!

03:03.620 --> 03:05.680
Go wash your face. Breakfast is...

03:13.970 --> 03:14.350
Now's...

03:15.050 --> 03:15.630
...the time...

03:16.410 --> 03:17.460
Satoshi?!

03:18.570 --> 03:19.000
I...

03:22.310 --> 03:22.960
I...

03:25.670 --> 03:27.090
Iron Tail...

03:27.450 --> 03:28.330
Pikachu...

03:30.330 --> 03:31.050
Satoshi!

03:32.930 --> 03:33.780
Satoshi?

03:34.050 --> 03:35.080
What is the matter?

03:37.250 --> 03:39.200
He feels hot... He's got a fever.

03:40.370 --> 03:41.670
Anyway, let us put him to bed.

03:42.200 --> 03:42.830
Yeah.

03:50.010 --> 03:51.690
His fever is extremely high.

03:52.170 --> 03:53.650
The towel gets hot immediately.

03:54.090 --> 03:57.390
He got wet yesterday, so he may have caught a cold.

03:58.830 --> 04:00.490
Pikachu, you're worried too, right?

04:00.850 --> 04:01.390
Do not worry.

04:02.290 --> 04:03.510
I will go look for medicine.

04:04.050 --> 04:05.890
Eureka too! Eureka will go too!

04:06.200 --> 04:07.060
Wait a second.

04:08.890 --> 04:09.790
We're here, so...

04:10.420 --> 04:12.160
There seems to be a pharmacy to the west.

04:12.530 --> 04:14.040
Eureka, take this.

04:14.390 --> 04:14.670
Okay.

04:16.420 --> 04:17.830
Please take care of Satoshi.

04:19.230 --> 04:20.110
Leave it to me!

04:21.950 --> 04:22.800
We are leaving!

04:28.790 --> 04:30.370
I have to pull myself together.

04:43.400 --> 04:45.770
Thank you, Yancham, Tairenar.

04:54.550 --> 04:56.680
He seems to be much better than earlier.

04:58.000 --> 04:58.320
Yeah.

04:58.880 --> 05:02.280
We'll have to keep doing our best until the two of them bring the medicine!

05:07.440 --> 05:09.450
It's so loud... What on Earth is going on?

05:11.720 --> 05:13.320
I'm the Wandering Guitarist!

05:14.430 --> 05:17.330
They also call me Jimmy the Pikachu Trainer!

05:22.180 --> 05:23.010
Wahey!

05:23.360 --> 05:26.370
Could that Pikachu be the Pikachu of Satoshi from Masara Town?

05:26.750 --> 05:28.340
The one that's rumored to be super strong?

05:29.640 --> 05:31.380
Uh, yeah, it is.

05:31.710 --> 05:34.980
Yay! To think we ran into you so quickly!

05:35.150 --> 05:36.480
Boy, I sure am lucky!

05:38.650 --> 05:40.490
Excuse me, can you be a bit more quiet...?

05:40.000 --> 05:40.490
And you!

05:40.970 --> 05:43.270
Do you know Satoshi from Masara Town?

05:43.720 --> 05:45.770
Yes, I do...

05:46.110 --> 05:48.500
Then tell him this:

05:48.800 --> 05:50.030
Wow!

05:50.830 --> 05:57.160
I'm the man who loves Pikachu so much that he never uses any other Pokémon, not even in battle!

05:57.880 --> 06:01.050
If I hear during my travels that there's a strong Pikachu in the west,

06:01.160 --> 06:03.040
I'll go there and battle it;

06:03.760 --> 06:06.330
if I hear the strongest Pikachu is in the east,

06:06.530 --> 06:09.860
I go there and make them admit that my Pikachu is the strongest!

06:09.860 --> 06:12.420
Uh... Can you turn down the volume a little?

06:12.960 --> 06:14.410
Satoshi from Masara Town,

06:14.970 --> 06:18.430
I challenge you to a Pokémon battle!

06:18.890 --> 06:20.840
And not just any Pokémon battle:

06:21.150 --> 06:25.440
I mean an earnest battle between Pikachu and Pikachu!

06:25.650 --> 06:27.070
Wow!

06:28.280 --> 06:30.810
Geez... Satoshi is gonna wake up at this rate...

06:33.560 --> 06:35.360
It's battle time, Satoshi!

06:35.630 --> 06:38.580
Show me that amazing skill you and your Pikachu are supposed to have!

06:39.190 --> 06:40.670
I got it, I got it!

06:41.150 --> 06:43.570
I'll call him now, so stop screaming.

06:43.570 --> 06:44.370
Will you call him for me?!

06:46.640 --> 06:47.670
Wait a second.

06:52.890 --> 06:56.980
If Satoshi hears about the battle, he'll say he'll do it for sure.

06:57.540 --> 06:58.420
Even if it means overworking himself...

07:01.490 --> 07:02.400
Gekkouga...

07:03.150 --> 07:04.280
Double Team...

07:07.680 --> 07:09.850
I can't let Satoshi battle in this state.

07:10.490 --> 07:16.200
But that Jimmy guy doesn't seem like the type of person who'd give up and go home, even if I tell him what's going on.

07:17.040 --> 07:19.070
I already promised him; what should I do...?

07:29.730 --> 07:30.750
I have no choice but to do it!

07:31.190 --> 07:32.260
It's for Satoshi's sake!

07:39.670 --> 07:40.550
Sorry to keep you waiting!

07:42.000 --> 07:43.850
I'm Satoshi from Masara Town!

07:47.560 --> 07:49.230
Pokémon Quiz.

07:49.390 --> 07:51.570
The answer is...?

07:52.970 --> 08:02.890
Coming up next:

07:52.970 --> 07:57.900
Pikachu VS Pikachu!

07:53.830 --> 07:58.550
Pocket Monsters XY&Z is brought to you by these sponsors.

07:57.930 --> 08:02.890
A hot and paralyzing electric shock battle!!

08:10.440 --> 08:11.280
What do you think, Satoshi?

08:11.870 --> 08:15.340
This is my Pikachu! The strongest of the strongest of the strongest!

08:15.840 --> 08:20.800
The ultimate Pikachu, Spike! Oh yeah!

08:21.350 --> 08:23.680
Thank goodness... At the moment he seems to believe me.

08:24.370 --> 08:27.540
Calm down, Serena. Do your best for Satoshi's sake!

08:31.510 --> 08:32.720
Thank you, Pikachu!

08:34.580 --> 08:37.680
I didn't think he'd actually find the brat boy.

08:37.680 --> 08:40.290
That kid's guts are admirable.

08:40.600 --> 08:43.610
Does he intend to defeat the brat boy's Pikachu?

08:44.280 --> 08:44.620
Hm...

08:45.130 --> 08:48.590
Well, you can't win with just guts.

08:50.040 --> 08:56.370
But if it really does turn out to be strong, we should go ahead and take the brat boy's Pikachu while it's weakened!

08:56.370 --> 08:57.210
Nice idea!

08:59.850 --> 09:00.400
Pikachu!

09:01.090 --> 09:02.200
I choose you!

09:03.990 --> 09:06.390
All right, come at me whenever you're ready!

09:11.170 --> 09:11.760
Pikachu,

09:12.260 --> 09:13.490
Quick Attack!

09:14.680 --> 09:16.410
We'll use Quick Attack too!

09:22.290 --> 09:23.570
Wow, it's fast!

09:23.880 --> 09:25.310
So the rumors are true.

09:25.880 --> 09:27.200
I'm getting fired up all of a sudden!

09:28.190 --> 09:30.270
Looks like that guy wasn't lying.

09:31.970 --> 09:33.460
It really is extremely well-trained!

09:33.870 --> 09:35.830
Spike, Thunder Punch!

09:37.470 --> 09:37.880
Dodge!

09:39.760 --> 09:40.700
Thunderbolt!

09:43.610 --> 09:44.600
Spike, Dig!

09:50.240 --> 09:51.620
Where is it going to come from now?!

09:52.040 --> 09:54.920
How would Satoshi get out of this tough spot?

10:00.170 --> 10:00.810
That's right!

10:01.200 --> 10:05.150
I've been watching Satoshi's battles more closely than anyone else!

10:05.680 --> 10:07.230
Use Iron Tail again!

10:11.790 --> 10:12.290
Pikachu,

10:12.760 --> 10:13.960
Iron Tail!

10:20.010 --> 10:20.670
I didn't know this was possible!

10:21.350 --> 10:23.720
Pikachu, use Iron Tail again!

10:32.930 --> 10:33.640
Are you all right?

10:35.280 --> 10:36.070
This is it.

10:36.660 --> 10:37.940
This is what I've been looking for!

10:38.440 --> 10:42.130
It's not over yet! There's more to the power of Satoshi from Masara Town than this!

10:42.670 --> 10:44.600
Thank goodness! It worked out!

10:46.230 --> 10:47.530
That's a good match.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.630
Which means...

10:49.630 --> 10:53.030
...if that Pikachu and the brat boy's Pikachu are on equal footing,

10:53.570 --> 10:55.830
why don't we take that one as well while we're at it?

10:56.230 --> 10:58.460
Gulp! You're a genius, Musashi!

10:58.790 --> 11:01.550
Well, if that's what you want to call me, I won't object!

11:02.520 --> 11:03.540
If we do that...

11:06.790 --> 11:07.530
Let me reward you.

11:07.530 --> 11:09.910
...my reward from Sakaki-sama...

11:08.150 --> 11:08.720
Let me reward you.

11:11.760 --> 11:13.430
...won't just be a dream!

11:14.430 --> 11:16.360
Hey, Nyarth?

11:18.990 --> 11:20.520
Let's get started.

11:21.680 --> 11:22.410
I hope he gets better soon.

11:26.180 --> 11:28.820
Bro, Satoshi will be fine if he takes this, right?

11:29.200 --> 11:31.150
Yeah, let us bring it to him quickly.

11:31.150 --> 11:31.530
Yeah!

11:32.970 --> 11:34.340
Bro, hurry!

11:34.340 --> 11:35.560
Wait, Eureka!

11:39.230 --> 11:39.910
Huh?

11:39.910 --> 11:40.760
Satoshi?

11:41.150 --> 11:42.240
He's battling?

11:43.510 --> 11:43.720
Hm?

11:44.340 --> 11:44.630
Wait...

11:47.230 --> 11:47.800
That is...

11:48.480 --> 11:49.560
Come at me!

11:49.560 --> 11:50.820
...Serena!

11:51.840 --> 11:52.930
Why are you wearing Satoshi's-

11:57.890 --> 11:58.440
Why are you we-

12:02.170 --> 12:03.150
Hm? Friends of yours?

12:03.850 --> 12:05.040
Uh... Yeah.

12:07.070 --> 12:07.850
They're my friends!

12:09.050 --> 12:10.160
Citron, did you get the medicine?

12:11.320 --> 12:13.570
We have obtained the medicine as promised...

12:14.470 --> 12:15.470
What about you, Serena?

12:16.820 --> 12:19.250
The thing is... Whisper whisper Nyasper...

12:20.340 --> 12:21.820
I-I see...

12:22.420 --> 12:24.130
I more or less understand the situation now.

12:24.950 --> 12:26.130
Leave the rest to us.

12:26.740 --> 12:28.130
I'm counting on you, Citron!

12:29.550 --> 12:30.400
Let us go, Eureka.

12:31.010 --> 12:31.360
Yeah.

12:35.030 --> 12:36.610
"Satoshi", do your best!

12:39.860 --> 12:41.980
Sorry I had to interrupt the battle.

12:43.710 --> 12:45.480
All right, let's start again!

12:46.510 --> 12:48.280
All right, drink this.

12:54.950 --> 12:57.730
Satoshi, get better soon.

12:57.730 --> 12:59.500
If the medicine works, he will.

13:00.130 --> 13:02.180
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

13:03.190 --> 13:05.650
In that case, let's put our rock spirit into this attack!

13:05.950 --> 13:07.610
Thunderbolt!

13:13.530 --> 13:14.390
Not bad!

13:14.840 --> 13:15.630
That's not all!

13:15.870 --> 13:16.930
Quick Attack!

13:17.380 --> 13:18.980
You use Quick Attack too!

13:25.800 --> 13:26.270
What?!

13:44.970 --> 13:50.950
If you ask us about whatever,

13:50.950 --> 13:56.890
It is the world's mercy that makes us answer!

13:57.300 --> 14:03.780
To prevent the world's destruction!

14:03.780 --> 14:10.080
To protect the world's peace!

14:10.360 --> 14:16.290
We've come, we've come for your sake!

14:18.100 --> 14:20.920
This world is so cruel, it's no good.

14:21.590 --> 14:24.610
Studying is no good, who would I do that for?

14:24.610 --> 14:27.140
That's why my days as a good kid end today!

14:27.140 --> 14:32.930
If love is evil, evil must be love too.

14:32.930 --> 14:38.800
They have almost the same letters anyway.

14:39.460 --> 14:42.120
Come on, it's time to reveal...

14:42.120 --> 14:44.100
...the identity of these cool street musicians!

14:44.570 --> 14:48.170
Listen up and listen good!

14:49.140 --> 14:49.650
Wham!

14:50.260 --> 14:52.660
Carrying out the evil of love and truth,

14:53.150 --> 14:55.310
we're lovely, charmy villains!

14:56.370 --> 14:56.910
Musashi!

14:57.280 --> 14:57.910
Kojiro!

14:58.260 --> 15:01.320
For the Rocket Gang duo dashing across the galaxy,

15:01.600 --> 15:04.370
a white hole, a white tomorrow awaits ahead!

15:04.370 --> 15:05.680
Just kidding!

15:10.750 --> 15:11.640
Nailed it.

15:12.680 --> 15:14.000
You're those guys from before!

15:14.200 --> 15:15.850
Huh? You know them?

15:16.110 --> 15:19.190
Those were the guys who told me about your Pikachu, Satoshi.

15:19.190 --> 15:20.100
What?!

15:20.790 --> 15:25.880
Our original plan was to get the brat boy's Pikachu after you had weakened it, but...

15:25.880 --> 15:28.250
Since there are two strong Pikachu around,

15:28.600 --> 15:31.170
we decided we'd just take both instead!

15:31.540 --> 15:32.110
Uh... Huh?

15:33.110 --> 15:35.110
I thought you were the brat boy, but you're actually the brat girl!

15:35.780 --> 15:36.450
This is bad...

15:36.740 --> 15:37.710
Oh, you're right.

15:38.270 --> 15:39.240
But why...?

15:39.990 --> 15:42.680
What's this? Are you cosplaying?

15:43.230 --> 15:43.940
"Brat boy"?

15:44.440 --> 15:45.170
"Brat girl"?

15:45.710 --> 15:46.160
"Cosplay"?

15:53.130 --> 15:54.890
It's no use, Pikachu.

15:54.890 --> 15:59.300
We implemented perfect countermeasures against Electric moves in this wire.

15:59.300 --> 16:01.870
All right, now that we've got them, there's no need to stay any longer.

16:03.080 --> 16:04.570
We're going home!

16:08.410 --> 16:09.470
Hold it!

16:15.530 --> 16:17.530
Who did this?!

16:19.270 --> 16:20.840
It's me, Rocket Gang!

16:21.410 --> 16:22.270
Satoshi!

16:23.850 --> 16:24.640
The brat boy!

16:25.830 --> 16:27.550
Satoshi, are you all right?

16:27.830 --> 16:29.670
Yeah, thanks to Citron and Eureka, that is.

16:30.500 --> 16:32.560
Sheesh, this is so typical of Satoshi...

16:33.050 --> 16:35.670
Normal people cannot recover from a cold within a day...

16:36.410 --> 16:37.650
Sorry, Serena.

16:38.230 --> 16:40.160
You had to battle in my stead, right?

16:41.050 --> 16:42.390
Wh-What's this about?

16:43.690 --> 16:45.390
I'll explain later.

16:45.880 --> 16:48.020
Getting back Pikachu comes first.

16:48.570 --> 16:50.280
I'm really sorry.

16:50.790 --> 16:52.170
I meant no harm.

16:54.330 --> 16:55.000
You...!

16:56.470 --> 16:57.220
Satoshi!

17:03.930 --> 17:05.480
All right, let's go, Gekkouga!

17:06.770 --> 17:10.050
We could've gone home while they were talking, and yet...

17:11.810 --> 17:13.500
Maaiika, Psybeam!

17:13.890 --> 17:15.240
You too, Pumpjin!

17:15.240 --> 17:16.030
Shadow Ball!

17:22.480 --> 17:24.390
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

17:27.680 --> 17:28.250
Back it up!

17:28.640 --> 17:29.850
Tairenar, Flamethrower!

17:30.160 --> 17:31.240
Yancham, Dark Pulse!

17:31.550 --> 17:32.890
Nymphia, Swift!

17:43.290 --> 17:44.070
She's not bad.

17:45.190 --> 17:47.040
Gekkouga, Cut!

17:53.320 --> 17:54.120
Pikachu was...!

17:54.200 --> 17:55.090
No!

17:59.330 --> 18:00.500
I'm so glad you're safe.

18:00.830 --> 18:02.530
Rock 'n' roll!

18:03.850 --> 18:04.740
Are you hurt?

18:07.390 --> 18:08.480
What shall we do?

18:08.480 --> 18:10.260
"What shall we do"? That's the last thing I'm worried about.

18:11.090 --> 18:11.850
This is bad...

18:11.850 --> 18:12.270
Gulp!

18:14.470 --> 18:16.190
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

18:16.370 --> 18:17.970
Spike, Thunderbolt!

18:27.330 --> 18:31.670
Ugh... Once again, my reward from Sakaki-sama will have to wait.

18:32.370 --> 18:33.360
What do you mean?

18:33.360 --> 18:35.490
What's this about?! I haven't heard about this!

18:35.770 --> 18:37.840
I'm talking about a dream!

18:38.410 --> 18:40.330
This feels bad!

18:44.160 --> 18:45.360
You did it, Pikachu.

18:47.050 --> 18:48.390
Thank you, everyone.

18:49.880 --> 18:51.060
By the way, you...

18:53.700 --> 18:56.130
I'm no fan of the fact that you tricked me,

18:57.170 --> 19:00.860
but your teamwork with Tairenar, Yancham and Nymphia...

19:01.760 --> 19:04.830
...was pretty on-point! Yay!

19:07.920 --> 19:08.830
Thank you!

19:09.600 --> 19:11.870
All right, let me treat you to a gig.

19:12.420 --> 19:13.250
Yay!

19:13.520 --> 19:14.240
Woo!

19:14.500 --> 19:16.070
Wow!

19:16.070 --> 19:18.740
Yeah, yeah! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow!

19:18.740 --> 19:20.410
Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow!

19:20.410 --> 19:22.010
Yay!

19:22.010 --> 19:23.150
Thank you!

19:25.320 --> 19:28.020
Oh, right. You've come to battle me, right?

19:28.440 --> 19:29.300
I think it's time for us to do this, then!

19:30.630 --> 19:31.830
Bring it on!

19:35.700 --> 19:38.900
...or not. Sorry, can I eat something first?

19:39.530 --> 19:40.180
Eat?

19:40.520 --> 19:43.250
I haven't eaten anything all day, so I'm starving.

19:44.950 --> 19:46.180
I will go cook something right away.

19:46.830 --> 19:48.920
Eureka will you help out!

19:51.590 --> 19:52.650
